@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Terms and Conditions";
}

<div class="modal fade"
     id="termsModal"
     tabindex="-1"
     aria-labelledby="termsModalLabel"
     aria-hidden="true">

    <div class="modal-dialog modal-xl modal-dialog-scrollable">

        <div class="modal-content">

            <div class="modal-header">
                <h4 class="modal-title" id="termsModalLabel">
                    PetHub Terms and Conditions
                </h4>

                <button type="button"
                        class="btn-close"
                        data-bs-dismiss="modal"
                        aria-label="Close">
                </button>
            </div>

            <div class="modal-body">

                <p>
                    <strong>Effective Date:</strong> October 2026
                </p>

            <p>
                Welcome to <strong>PetHub</strong>. These Terms and Conditions govern your
                access to and use of the PetHub website and its services.
                Please read them carefully before creating an account.
            </p>

            <p>
                By registering for a PetHub account, you confirm that you have read,
                understood, and agreed to comply with these Terms and Conditions.
                If you do not agree with any part of these Terms, you should not proceed
                with your registration.
            </p>

            <hr />

            <h3>1. Acceptance of Terms</h3>
            <p>
                By creating and using a PetHub account, you agree to comply with these
                Terms and Conditions, our Privacy Policy, and all applicable laws
                and regulations.
            </p>

            <h3>2. Eligibility</h3>
            <p>To register for a PetHub account, you must:</p>

            <ul>
                <li>Be at least eighteen (18) years of age, or register with the consent and supervision of a parent or legal guardian.</li>
                <li>Provide complete, accurate, and truthful information during registration.</li>
                <li>Keep your account information updated whenever necessary.</li>
            </ul>

            <h3>3. Member Account</h3>

            <p>
                Members are responsible for maintaining the confidentiality of their
                account credentials.
            </p>

            <p>You agree to:</p>

            <ul>
                <li>Keep your password secure.</li>
                <li>Protect your account from unauthorized access.</li>
                <li>Notify PetHub immediately if you suspect unauthorized use of your account.</li>
                <li>Be responsible for all activities conducted using your account.</li>
            </ul>

            <h3>4. Proper Use of PetHub</h3>

            <p>Members agree to use the platform responsibly and only for lawful purposes.</p>

            <p>Members must not:</p>

            <ul>
                <li>Create fake or duplicate accounts.</li>
                <li>Provide false or misleading information.</li>
                <li>Impersonate another person or organization.</li>
                <li>Upload malicious software or harmful content.</li>
                <li>Attempt to interfere with the operation or security of the website.</li>
                <li>Use PetHub for fraudulent or illegal activities.</li>
            </ul>

            <h3>5. Marketplace Listings</h3>

            <p>
                PetHub allows members to post cats and dogs for sale or adoption through
                the Marketplace.
            </p>

            <p>Members are responsible for ensuring that:</p>

            <ul>
                <li>All listings contain accurate and truthful information.</li>
                <li>Uploaded photos accurately represent the listed pet.</li>
                <li>Listings comply with applicable animal welfare laws.</li>
                <li>Listings do not contain false, misleading, or prohibited content.</li>
            </ul>

            <p>
                PetHub provides an online platform that connects pet owners, buyers,
                sellers, and adopters. Any communication, agreements, payments,
                meetups, or transactions between users are solely the responsibility
                of the users involved.
            </p>

            <h3>6. Animal Welfare Commitment</h3>

            <p>
                PetHub is built on the belief that pets are living companions who deserve
                love and proper care at all times, whether they are being rehomed or are
                currently in your care.
            </p>

            <p>Every member must agree to:</p>

            <ul>
                <li><strong>Responsible Ownership:</strong> Provide food, shelter, and proper medical care for your pet.</li>
                <li><strong>Long-Term Care:</strong> Recognize that pet ownership is a lifelong commitment.</li>
                <li><strong>Safe Educational Content:</strong> Share only responsible and accurate pet care information.</li>
                <li><strong>No Neglect:</strong> Animal abuse or neglect is strictly prohibited.</li>
            </ul>

            <p>
                PetHub may share educational reminders and responsible pet ownership tips.
            </p>

            <h3>7. Lost and Found Reporting</h3>

            <p>Members may submit reports for lost or found cats and dogs.</p>

            <p>All reports must:</p>

            <ul>
                <li>Contain truthful and accurate information.</li>
                <li>Include appropriate descriptions and photographs whenever available.</li>
                <li>Not contain false or misleading information.</li>
            </ul>

            <p>
                PetHub helps facilitate community reporting but does not guarantee
                the recovery of lost pets.
            </p>

            <h3>8. Community Guidelines</h3>

            <p>Members must not:</p>

            <ul>
                <li>Harass, threaten, bully, or discriminate against other users.</li>
                <li>Post offensive, abusive, illegal, or inappropriate content.</li>
                <li>Engage in scams, fraudulent activities, or spam.</li>
                <li>Promote or participate in animal abuse or cruelty.</li>
                <li>Sell or advertise animals prohibited by law.</li>
                <li>Upload false or misleading information.</li>
            </ul>

            <p>
                PetHub reserves the right to remove content or suspend accounts
                that violate these guidelines.
            </p>

            <h3>9. Member Content</h3>

            <p>
                Members retain ownership of the content they upload. By submitting
                content to PetHub, you grant the platform permission to display,
                store, and process that content for operating and improving the website.
            </p>

            <h3>10. Privacy</h3>

            <p>
                PetHub collects personal information necessary to provide its services,
                including registration, messaging, notifications, marketplace listings,
                and lost and found reporting.
            </p>

            <p>
                While reasonable security measures are implemented, no online platform
                can guarantee absolute security.
            </p>

            <p>
                Please refer to the Privacy Policy for additional information.
            </p>

            <h3>11. Account Suspension</h3>

            <p>PetHub may suspend or terminate accounts that:</p>

            <ul>
                <li>Violate these Terms.</li>
                <li>Provide false information.</li>
                <li>Engage in illegal or fraudulent activities.</li>
                <li>Repeatedly violate Community Guidelines.</li>
                <li>Endanger other members or animals.</li>
            </ul>

            <h3>12. Limitation of Liability</h3>

            <p>
                PetHub serves only as an online platform connecting pet owners,
                adopters, buyers, sellers, and community members.
            </p>

            <p>PetHub is not responsible for:</p>

            <ul>
                <li>User-generated content.</li>
                <li>Transactions between users.</li>
                <li>Injuries, illnesses, or damages involving pets.</li>
                <li>Disputes between users.</li>
                <li>Failure to recover lost pets.</li>
            </ul>

            <h3>13. Changes to These Terms</h3>

            <p>
                PetHub may update these Terms and Conditions at any time.
                Continued use of the platform constitutes acceptance of the updated Terms.
            </p>

            <h3>14. Contact Us</h3>

            <p>
                For questions, concerns, or reports regarding these Terms and Conditions,
                please contact the PetHub administrators through the official contact
                information available on the website.
            </p>

            <hr />

            <h3>User Agreement</h3>

            <div class="alert alert-info">
                By creating an account and selecting the agreement checkbox during
                registration, you confirm that you have read, understood, and agree
                to the PetHub Terms and Conditions and Privacy Policy.
            </div>

        </div>

        <div class="modal-footer">

            <button type="button"
                    class="btn btn-secondary"
                    data-bs-dismiss="modal">
                Close
            </button>

        </div>

    </div>

</div>

</div>